OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to reopen ski slope and high
OL,4,Arope course
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been announced to reopen a
OL,7,Fdry ski slope and high rope courses in
OL,8,Fa Kent town.
OL,10,FThe outdoor facilities were stopped
OL,11,Fwhen Folkestone Sports Centre closed in
OL,12,FJuly 2024 after its owners went into
OL,13,Fadministration.
OL,15,FThe centre's current owner, The Sports
OL,16,FTrust, has announced a new partnership
OL,17,Fwith Boonies Outdoors to restore the
OL,18,Fopen-air facilities.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
