OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to reopen ski slope and high
OL,4,Arope course
OL,5,
OL,6,FJay Ingram, funder and director of
OL,7,FBoonies, said: "The opportunity to
OL,8,Fbreathe new life into the ski slope and
OL,9,Fhigh ropes course, alongside developing
OL,10,Fplans for a new outdoor adventure and
OL,11,Fobstacle course facility, is something
OL,12,Fwe're incredibly passionate about."
